            "family_income.py concepts and do not assert sex.",
            "Farm income covers both head/reference person and spouse "
            "and includes labor and asset portions. Business losses "
            "enter business_asset, with business_labor zero for a loss.",
            "The labor aggregates exclude farm and "
            "unincorporated-business income. Those amounts enter "
            "taxable income separately.",
            "Head/reference-person and spouse pensions, annuities, IRAs "
            "and other retirement remain separate. Other-family-member "
            "retirement and annuities remain combined.",
            "Spouse VA pension and alimony are separate generated "
            "components included in the joint transfer aggregate.",
            "Generated SSI carriers are head_ssi, wife_ssi and "
            "ofum_ssi, each with an accuracy flag.",
            "Documented upper dollar endpoints are retained as "
            "recorded; generated codebooks do not identify them as "
            "missing sentinels.",
            "Census needs-standard bounds are the wave-specific "
            "documented range, including the upper endpoint wrapped "
            "onto the following codebook line.",
            "All wealth amounts are imputed; codebook assigns all "
            "missing data. Zero represents no balance or an "
            "inapplicable item. Accuracy codes 0 and 1 distinguish not "
            "imputed and imputed.",
            "Component domain endpoints are documented as actual "
            "amounts; the codebook does not identify a distinct "
            "top-code sentinel.",
            "Business/farm assets and debts and other-real-estate "
            "assets and debts are separate; subtract each liability "
            "once. Vehicles, stocks and other assets are already net of "
            "debts secured on them.",
            "Checking/saving and money-market accounts (W28A) are "
            "separate from CDs, government bonds and Treasury bills "
